y individual in long term - like getting Merits or Specializations for particular member. So asked <b>Mr. Gone</b> to add 'Other' section on Pack Sheet on 2nd page. Hopes you like it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/OLmY3fl\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OLmY3fl.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T04:16:17-07:00","id":1325931,"title":"","content":"Reading Pure section in <b>Shunned by the Moon</b>, I found out we forgot about one, very important element of Uratha for Sacred Hunt - <i>Hunter's Aspect</i> of character. Each time Uratha have on it Scared Hunt ritual blessing - he get's specific Condition and makes effect on the Prey. So I think this section should be marked like this:<br /> <br /> 'Hunter's Aspect:______________<br /> Condition:____________________'<br /> <br /> Or maybe 'Hunter's Condition' should be? What do you all think about it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"r